#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "* NVDA 2026.3 or later is required.\n"
"* Added memory and disk size notation setting to configure how NVDA announces RAM and disk usage/size unit (default is alternative (kb/mb/...).\n"
"* Improved reliability of add-on settings upgrade process.\n"
"* The default value for wi-fi notification setting is now 'both' instead of 'off'."
msgstr ""

